OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts operator Adura says the field would
OL,8,Fprovide about 6% of UK gas production,
OL,9,Fenough to power 1.4 million homes
OL,11,FBut environmentalists say extracting
OL,12,Fmore fossil fuels will hamper efforts
OL,13,Fto cut carbon emissions - here's a
OL,14,Freminder of the UK and Scotland's net
OL,15,Fzero targets
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
