OL,3,AFrance is divided over who to blame for
OL,4,Aweekend riots and what to learn from
OL,5,Athem
OL,6,
OL,7,F"This is not the face of France! You
OL,8,Fmedia all focus on the violence and
OL,9,Fdestruction of Saturday's protests. But
OL,10,Fthat's not the majority. It's not 'us'.
OL,11,FThat's not France!"
OL,13,FElisabeth was speaking to me in front
OL,14,Fof a row of smashed shop windows,
OL,15,Fshattered glass still littering the
OL,16,Ftree-lined Parisian street. Its walls
OL,17,Fwere daubed with red-lettered graffiti
OL,18,Finsulting French police and signed with
OL,19,Fthe date of the riots, 17 October.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
