OL,3,AHusband of attacked Australian MP says
OL,4,Ashe had to have both legs amputated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhil Haines, husband of MP Helen
OL,7,FHaines, confirms she has had to have
OL,8,Fboth legs amputated
OL,10,FHe added that the "good news" was that
OL,11,Fshe was "alive and stable"
OL,13,FHaines suffered severe lower body
OL,14,Finjuries on Monday when she was hit by
OL,15,Fa car
OL,17,FThe man charged over the alleged
OL,18,Fattack, Brendan Nugent, has briefly
OL,19,Ffaced court. Our correspondent Katy
OL,20,FWatson was in the courtroom
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
