OL,3,AHusband of attacked Australian MP says
OL,4,Ashe had to have both legs amputated
OL,5,
OL,6,FNugent, 43, did not apply for bail. He
OL,7,Fis due to return to court in February
OL,9,FHe has been charged with dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving causing serious injury,
OL,11,Fintentionally causing serious injury,
OL,12,Fand causing harm to a Commonwealth
OL,13,Fpublic official
OL,15,FPolice have not ruled out additional
OL,16,Fcharges, including attempted murder
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
