OL,3,AElon Musk considering Tesla-SpaceX
OL,4,Amerger
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has said he is actively
OL,7,Fconsidering merging Tesla and SpaceX,
OL,8,Fhis two biggest companies.
OL,10,F"Do I think it would be a good idea?
OL,11,FYes," Musk said during a call with
OL,12,Ffinancial analysts over the quarterly
OL,13,Fbusiness results of SpaceX on Tuesday.
OL,15,FWhile Musk noted the certainty of such
OL,16,Fa merger should not be assumed, and it
OL,17,Fwould need shareholders' support, he
OL,18,Fsaid special committees within both
OL,19,Fcompanies have been formed to examine
OL,20,Fthe move.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792565291
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AElon Musk considering Tesla-SpaceX
OL,4,Amerger
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The special committees have not
OL,7,Freached agreement on terms of any
OL,8,Ftransaction and there's no guarantee
OL,9,Fthat they will," Musk added. "But I do
OL,10,Fthink there is a lot of merit to
OL,11,Fmerging and a lot to be gained."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
